## Recommendation Workflow

The recommendation process follows four steps:

1. Identify behavioural profiles compatible with the dataset properties and analytical task.
2. Retain only Pareto-optimal profiles.
3. Apply lexicographic ranking according to the user-defined objective priorities.
4. Generate explanations and visual trade-off summaries.
5. Display ressource efficiency indicators (present and future)
